#. module: ai
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_get_fields
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Lists ONLY searchable fields for a single model that can be used "
"in domain filters and grouping.\n"
"            Essential for building valid domains - if a field isn't listed "
"here, it CANNOT be used.\n"
"\n"
"            Returns format:\n"
"            ```\n"
"            field_name|display_name|type|sortable|groupable|description\n"
"            partner_id|Customer|many2one(res.partner)|true|true|Customer for "
"this order\n"
"            date_order|Order Date|datetime|true|true|Date when order was "
"placed\n"
"            order_line|Order Lines|one2many(sale.order.line)|false|false|"
"Lines in this order\n"
"            state|Status|selection|true|true|Order status\n"
"            ```\n"
"\n"
"            Key points:\n"
"            - ⚠️ Only returns SEARCHABLE fields - others cannot be used in "
"domains\n"
"            - For relationships: Shows related model in parentheses "
"(many2one, one2many, many2many)\n"
"            - Only relationship fields can be used to traverse to other "
"models\n"
"            - Literal fields such as char/text/float CANNOT be used for "
"traversal\n"
"            - 'sortable' indicates if field can be used in order_by "
"parameter\n"
"            - 'groupable' indicates if field can be used for grouping when "
"not available in search view\n"
"\n"
"            💡 Performance tip: When exploring multiple models, call this "
"tool multiple times in ONE message\n"
"            Example: Exploring sale.order, product.product, and res.partner? "
"Make 3 parallel calls.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"            Navaja SAMO iskalna polja za posamezen model, ki jih je mogoče "
"uporabiti v filtrih domen in združevanju.\n"
"            Bistveno za ustvarjanje veljavnih domen – če polje ni navedeno "
"tukaj, ga NI MOGOČE uporabiti.\n"
"\n"
"            Vrnjena oblika:\n"
"            ```\n"
"            field_name|display_name|type|sortable|groupable|description\n"
"            partner_id|Stranka|many2one(res.partner)|true|true|Stranka za to "
"naročilo\n"
"            date_order|Datum naročila|datetime|true|true|Datum oddaje "
"naročila\n"
"            order_line|Postavke naročila|one2many(sale.order.line)|false|"
"false|Postavke v tem naročilu\n"
"            state|Stanje|selection|true|true|Stanje naročila\n"
"            ```\n"
"\n"
"            Ključne točke:\n"
"            - ⚠️ Vrne samo ISKALNA polja – drugih ni mogoče uporabiti v "
"domenah\n"
"            - Pri relacijah: prikaže povezani model v oklepajih (many2one, "
"one2many, many2many)\n"
"            - Za prehajanje na druge modele je mogoče uporabiti samo "
"relacijska polja\n"
"            - Dobesednih polj, kot so char/text/float, NI MOGOČE uporabiti "
"za prehajanje\n"
"            - 'sortable' označuje, ali je polje mogoče uporabiti v parametru "
"order_by\n"
"            - 'groupable' označuje, ali je polje mogoče uporabiti za "
"združevanje, kadar ni na voljo v iskalnem pogledu\n"
"\n"
"            💡 Nasvet za zmogljivost: Pri raziskovanju več modelov pokličite "
"to orodje večkrat v ENEM sporočilu\n"
"            Primer: Raziskujete sale.order, product.product in res.partner? "
"Izvedite 3 vzporedne klice.\n"
"        "

#. module: ai
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_compute_report_measures
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Lists numeric fields (measures) available for aggregation in "
"pivot/graph views.\n"
"            MUST be called before using measures in open_menu_pivot() or "
"open_menu_graph().\n"
"\n"
"            Returns CSV with pipe (|) delimiter:\n"
"            ```\n"
"            field_name|display_name|type|aggregator|sortable\n"
"            __count|Count|integer||true\n"
"            amount_total|Total|monetary|sum|true\n"
"            margin|Margin|float|sum|true\n"
"            quantity|Quantity|float|sum|true\n"
"            ```\n"
"\n"
"            Key points:\n"
"            - __count is always available (counts records)\n"
"            - Only numeric fields with aggregators are returned\n"
"            - Use field_name in measures parameter\n"
"            - For rankings in pivot: Add ordering (e.g., \"amount_total "
"desc\")\n"
"            - Call multiple times in parallel if comparing different menus\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Izpiše seznam številskih polj (mere), ki so na voljo za "
"agregacijo v pogledih pivot/graph.\n"
"            MORA se klicati pred uporabo meritev v open_menu_pivot() ali "
"open_menu_graph().\n"
"\n"
"            Vrne CSV z ločilom cevi (|):\n"
"            ```\n"
"            field_name|display_name|type|aggregator|sortable\n"
"            __count|Count|integer||true\n"
"            amount_total|Total|monetary|sum|true\n"
"            margin|Margin|float|sum|true\n"
"            quantity|Quantity|float|sum|true\n"
"            ```\n"
"\n"
"            Ključne točke:\n"
"            - __count je vedno na voljo (prešteje zapise)\n"
"            - Vrnejo se samo številska polja z agregatorji\n"
"            - Uporabite field_name v parametru measures\n"
"            - Za razvrščanje v pivotu: dodajte vrstni red (npr. "
"\"amount_total desc\")\n"
"            - Kličite večkrat vzporedno, če primerjate različne menije\n"
"        "

#. module: ai
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_open_menu_graph
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Opens a graph/chart view using search view elements.\n"
"            Best for: Trends, comparisons, distributions, visual KPIs.\n"
"\n"
"            Supported chart types:\n"
"            - 'bar': Compare values across categories\n"
"            - 'line': Show trends over time\n"
"            - 'pie': Display proportions of a whole\n"
"\n"
"            Features:\n"
"            - Apply filters from menu's available options\n"
"            - Visualize a single measure\n"
"            - Group by one field for the chart axis\n"
"            - Search within specific fields\n"
"            - Stacking and cumulation options\n"
"            - Order control (ASC/DESC)\n"
"\n"
"            💡 Call compute_report_measures() first to find valid measures\n"
"            ⚠️ Each search string must use format 'field=text'. Array can "
"contain multiple search strings or be empty []\n"
"            ⚠️ Mode must be exactly 'bar', 'line', or 'pie'\n"
"            ⚠️ Order must be exactly 'ASC' or 'DESC'\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"            Odpre pogled grafa/grafikona z uporabo elementov iskalnega "
"pogleda.\n"
"            Najbolj primerno za: trende, primerjave, porazdelitve, vizualne "
"KPI-je.\n"
"\n"
"            Podprte vrste grafikonov:\n"
"            - 'bar': Primerjava vrednosti po kategorijah\n"
"            - 'line': Prikaz trendov skozi čas\n"
"            - 'pie': Prikaz deležev celote\n"
"\n"
"            Funkcionalnosti:\n"
"            - Uporaba filtrov iz razpoložljivih možnosti menija\n"
"            - Vizualizacija ene same meritve\n"
"            - Združevanje po enem polju za os grafikona\n"
"            - Iskanje znotraj določenih polj\n"
"            - Možnosti zlaganja in kumulacije\n"
"            - Nadzor vrstnega reda (ASC/DESC)\n"
"\n"
"            💡 Najprej pokličite compute_report_measures(), da poiščete "
"veljavne meritve\n"
"            ⚠️ Vsak iskalni niz mora uporabljati obliko 'field=text'. Seznam "
"lahko vsebuje več iskalnih nizov ali je prazen []\n"
"            ⚠️ Način mora biti natančno 'bar', 'line' ali 'pie'\n"
"            ⚠️ Vrstni red mora biti natančno 'ASC' ali 'DESC'\n"
"        "

#. module: ai
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_open_menu_kanban
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Opens a kanban (card-based) view using search view elements.\n"
"            Best for: Stage/status visualization, pipeline views, workflow "
"management.\n"
"\n"
"            Key features:\n"
"            - Display records as cards in columns\n"
"            - Apply filters from menu's available options\n"
"            - Group by workflow stages or other fields\n"
"            - Search within specific fields\n"
"            - Ideal for CRM pipelines, task boards, project workflows\n"
"\n"
"            ⚠️ Use only filter names and groupby fields from menu data\n"
"            ⚠️ Each search string must use format 'field=text'. Array can "
"contain multiple search strings or be empty []\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"            Odpre kanban (kartični) pogled z uporabo elementov iskalnega "
"pogleda.\n"
"            Najbolj primerno za: vizualizacijo stopenj/stanj, poglede "
"cevovodov, upravljanje delovnih tokov.\n"
"\n"
"            Ključne funkcije:\n"
"            - Prikaz zapisov kot kartic v stolpcih\n"
"            - Uporaba filtrov iz razpoložljivih možnosti menija\n"
"            - Združevanje po stopnjah delovnega toka ali drugih poljih\n"
"            - Iskanje znotraj določenih polj\n"
"            - Idealno za CRM-cevovode, table opravil in projektne delovne "
"tokove\n"
"\n"
"            ⚠️ Uporabljajte samo imena filtrov in polja groupby iz podatkov "
"menija\n"
"            ⚠️ Vsak iskalni niz mora uporabljati obliko 'field=text'. Matrika "
"lahko vsebuje več iskalnih nizov ali je prazna []"

#. module: ai
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_open_menu_list
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Opens a list (table) view using search view elements.\n"
"            Best for: \"Show me\", \"List all\", detailed record viewing, "
"sorting data.\n"
"\n"
"            Key features:\n"
"            - Apply multiple filters by name (from menu's search view)\n"
"            - Group records by available fields\n"
"            - Search within specific fields for text\n"
"            - Displays records in sortable table format\n"
"            - Ideal for reviewing, filtering, and exporting data\n"
"\n"
"            💡 Use search parameter to filter by any searchable field BEFORE "
"considering custom domains\n"
"            ⚠️ Use only filter names and groupby fields from menu data\n"
"            ⚠️ Each search string must use format 'field=text'. Array can "
"contain multiple search strings or be empty []\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"            Odpre pogled seznama (tabele) z uporabo elementov iskalnega "
"pogleda.\n"
"            Najbolj primerno za: \"Prikaži mi\", \"Prikaži vse\", podroben "
"pregled zapisov, razvrščanje podatkov.\n"
"\n"
"            Ključne funkcije:\n"
"            - Uporaba več filtrov po imenu (iz iskalnega pogleda menija)\n"
"            - Združevanje zapisov po razpoložljivih poljih\n"
"            - Iskanje besedila znotraj določenih polj\n"
"            - Prikaz zapisov v razvrstljivi obliki tabele\n"
"            - Idealno za pregledovanje, filtriranje in izvoz podatkov\n"
"\n"
"            💡 Uporabite parameter search za filtriranje po katerem koli "
"polju, po katerem je mogoče iskati, PRED upoštevanjem domen po meri\n"
"            ⚠️ Uporabite samo imena filtrov in polja groupby iz podatkov "
"menija\n"
"            ⚠️ Vsak iskalni niz mora uporabljati obliko 'field=text'. Polje "
"lahko vsebuje več iskalnih nizov ali pa je prazno []"

#. module: ai
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_open_menu_pivot
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Opens a pivot table with advanced search and filtering.\n"
"            Best for: \"Top N\" queries, rankings, cross-tabulation, "
"performance metrics.\n"
"\n"
"            Key features:\n"
"            - Supports filters from search view\n"
"            - Groups data by rows AND columns simultaneously\n"
"            - Aggregates measures (sum, avg, count)\n"
"            - Supports text search across searchable fields\n"
"            - Excel-like pivot table functionality\n"
"\n"
"            💡 ALWAYS call compute_report_measures() first to get valid "
"measures\n"
"            💡 For rankings: Include ordering in measures (e.g., "
"[\"amount_total desc\"])\n"
"            💡 Use search parameter to filter by any searchable field BEFORE "
"considering custom domains\n"
"            ⚠️ Prefer \"Reporting\" app menus for best pivot experience\n"
"            ⚠️ Each search string must use format 'field=text'. Array can "
"contain multiple search strings or be empty []\n"
"            ⚠️ Note: Uses row_groupbys/col_groupbys (arrays) instead of "
"selected_groupbys\n"
"\n"
"            Example: For \"top salespeople selling office products\":\n"
"            - Use search=[\"categ_id\", \"office\"] if categ_id is "
"searchable\n"
"            - Only use custom_domain if no searchable field matches your "
"needs\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Odpre vrtilno preglednico z naprednim iskanjem in filtriranjem.\n"
"            Najboljše za: poizvedbe \"Top N\", razvrstitve, križno analizo, "
"kazalnike uspešnosti.\n"
"\n"
"            Ključne funkcije:\n"
"            - Podpira filtre iz pogleda iskanja\n"
"            - Hkrati združuje podatke po vrsticah IN stolpcih\n"
"            - Agregira mere (sum, avg, count)\n"
"            - Podpira besedilno iskanje po iskalnih poljih\n"
"            - Funkcionalnost vrtilne preglednice, podobna Excelu\n"
"\n"
"            💡 VEDNO najprej pokličite compute_report_measures(), da dobite "
"veljavne mere\n"
"            💡 Za razvrstitve: vključite razvrščanje v mere (npr. "
"[\"amount_total desc\"])\n"
"            💡 Uporabite parameter search za filtriranje po kateremkoli "
"iskalnem polju, preden upoštevate custom domains\n"
"            ⚠️ Prednostno uporabljajte menije aplikacije \"Poročanje\" za "
"najboljšo izkušnjo z vrtilno preglednico\n"
"            ⚠️ Vsak iskalni niz mora uporabljati zapis 'field=text'. Polje "
"lahko vsebuje več iskalnih nizov ali je lahko prazno []\n"
"            ⚠️ Opomba: Uporablja row_groupbys/col_groupbys (arrays) namesto "
"selected_groupbys\n"
"\n"
"            Primer: Za \"najboljše prodajalce pisarniških izdelkov\":\n"
"            - Uporabite search=[\"categ_id\", \"office\"], če je polje "
"categ_id iskalno\n"
"            - Uporabite custom_domain samo, če nobeno iskalno polje ne "
"ustreza vašim potrebam\n"
"        "

#. module: ai
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_get_menu_details
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Retrieves detailed information (context, domain, search_view) "
"for specific menus.\n"
"            MUST be called before using any open_menu_* tool to get menu-"
"specific details.\n"
"\n"
"            Returns CSV with pipe (|) delimiter:\n"
"            ```\n"
"            menu_id|model_name|context|domain|search_view\n"
"            389|sale.order|{\"search_default_my_quotation\": 1}|[]|"
"<search><fields>...</fields></search>\n"
"            172|account.move|{\"search_default_draft\": 1}|[[\"type\", "
"\"=\", \"out_invoice\"]]|<search>...</search>\n"
"            ```\n"
"\n"
"            Key information:\n"
"            - Context: Default filters/groupings applied when menu opens\n"
"            - Domain: Permanent filters that cannot be removed by users\n"
"            - Search_view: Full XML structure with available filters, "
"groupbys, and searchable fields\n"
"\n"
"            💡 Performance tip: Request multiple menu details in one call "
"when comparing options\n"
"            ⚠️ Always validate the returned model matches your expectations\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            Pridobi podrobne informacije (context, domain, search_view) za "
"določene menije.\n"
"            MORA biti poklican pred uporabo katerega koli orodja open_menu_* "
"za pridobitev podrobnosti, specifičnih za posamezne menije.\n"
"\n"
"            Vrne CSV z ločilnikom cevi (|):\n"
"            ```\n"
"            menu_id|model_name|context|domain|search_view\n"
"            389|sale.order|{\"search_default_my_quotation\": 1}|[]|"
"<search><fields>...</fields></search>\n"
"            172|account.move|{\"search_default_draft\": 1}|[[\"type\", "
"\"=\", \"out_invoice\"]]|<search>...</search>\n"
"            ```\n"
"\n"
"            Ključne informacije:\n"
"            - Context: privzeti filtri in možnosti razvrščanja, ki se "
"uporabijo ob odprtju menija\n"
"            - Domain: trajni filtri, ki jih uporabniki ne morejo odstraniti\n"
"            - Search_view: polna XML struktura z razpoložljivimi filtri, "
"možnostmi razvrščanja po skupinah in iskalnimi polji\n"
"\n"
"            💡 Nasvet za zmogljivost: pri primerjanju možnosti zahtevajte "
"podrobnosti več menijev v enem klicu\n"
"            ⚠️ Vedno preverite, ali se vrnjen model ujema z vašimi "
"pričakovanji\n"
"        "

#. module: ai
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_read_group
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_search
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Searches a particular model using a domain. The provided domain "
"must be in valid JSON format.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"            Išče določen model z uporabo domene. Podana domena mora biti v "
"veljavni obliki JSON.\n"
"        "

#. module: ai
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai.ir_actions_server_adjust_search
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"\n"
"            The user can continue on asking questions and if you think that "
"the current search can just be adjusted without opening a different menu, "
"you can use this tool.\n"
"\n"
"            Provided in the prompt's <session_info_context> is a current "
"view info which contains the active search facets.\n"
"            A facet can be a group of `OR`ed filters, a group of groupbys, "
"or a group of `OR`ed search terms.\n"
"\n"
"            **Understanding the parameters**:\n"
"            - `remove_facets` - Removing a facet removes the whole group of "
"filters/groupbys/search terms. Removing a filter or a search facet reduces "
"the constraints.\n"
"            - `toggle_filters` - Toggling a filter will add/remove a filter "
"from an active filter facet.\n"
"            - `toggle_groupbys` - Toggling a groupby will add/remove a "
"groupby from the active groupbys facet.\n"
"            - `apply_searches` - Applying a search will `OR` the search term "
"on an active search facet containing the same field. E.g., if there is a "
"field facet of \"name=John\" and you provide search \"name=Jane\", the "
"resulting search will be \"name=John OR name=Jane\".\n"
"            - `measures` - Specifying measures will activate the selected "
"measures in the current view if it's a pivot or a graph view.\n"
"            - `mode` - Graph view only: This is the chart type. Choose from "
"\"line\", \"bar\", or \"pie\" to change the chart type in the current graph "
"view.\n"
"            - `order` - Graph view only: Specifying the order will change "
"the sorting of the results in the current graph view.\n"
"            - `stacked` - Graph view only: Specifying stacked will change "
"the stacking of the results in the current graph view.\n"
"            - `cumulated` - Graph view only: Specifying cumulated will "
"change the accumulation of the results in the current graph view.\n"
"            - `custom_domain` - The search view elements may not be "
"sufficient to express the needed domain. In that case, you can provide a "
"custom domain as a JSON string.\n"
"            - `switch_view_type` - Switching the view type will change the "
"current view to the specified type. Select from the available view types in "
"the current view info.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"            Uporabnik lahko nadaljuje s postavljanjem vprašanj in če menite, "
"da je mogoče trenutno iskanje samo prilagoditi, ne da bi odprli drug meni, "
"lahko uporabite to orodje.\n"
"\n"
"            V <session_info_context> poziva so navedene informacije o "
"trenutnem pogledu, ki vsebujejo aktivne iskalne fasete.\n"
"            Faseta je lahko skupina filtrov, povezanih z `OR`, skupina "
"združevanj ali skupina iskalnih izrazov, povezanih z `OR`.\n"
"\n"
"            **Razumevanje parametrov**:\n"
"            - `remove_facets` – Odstranitev fasete odstrani celotno skupino "
"filtrov/združevanj/iskalnih izrazov. Odstranitev filtra ali iskalne fasete "
"zmanjša omejitve.\n"
"            - `toggle_filters` – Preklapljanje filtra bo dodalo filter v "
"aktivno faseto filtrov ali ga iz nje odstranilo.\n"
"            - `toggle_groupbys` – Preklapljanje združevanja bo dodalo "
"združevanje v aktivno faseto združevanj ali ga iz nje odstranilo.\n"
"            - `apply_searches` – Uporaba iskanja bo iskalni izraz povezala z "
"`OR` v aktivni iskalni faseti, ki vsebuje isto polje. Če je na primer "
"prisotna faseta polja »name=John« in navedete iskanje »name=Jane«, bo "
"rezultat iskanje »name=John OR name=Jane«.\n"
"            - `measures` – Z navedbo meritev boste aktivirali izbrane "
"meritve v trenutnem pogledu, če gre za vrtilni graf ali grafični pogled.\n"
"            - `mode` – Samo za grafični pogled: To je vrsta grafikona. "
"Izberite med »line«, »bar« ali »pie«, da spremenite vrsto grafikona v "
"trenutnem grafičnem pogledu.\n"
"            - `order` – Samo za grafični pogled: Z navedbo vrstnega reda "
